<p>Apart from the above APIs, the user can use RPC polling and control latency for better performance in high performance modes.</p>
<p><strong>RPC Polling and Latency Settings</strong> - rpcPollingTimeConfig parameter can be used to request for a rpc polling time in micro seconds,
rpcControlLatencyConfig parameter can be used to reduce CPU wakeup delays.</p>
<div class="highlight-default notranslate"><div class="highlight"><pre class="pre codeblock"><code data-highlighted="yes" class="hljs language-cpp">sample_app::StatusCode sample_app::QnnSampleApp::<span class="hljs-built_in">setRpcLatencyAndPolling</span>() {
