<h2 id="qnn-htp-analysis-summary-qhas-">QNN HTP Analysis Summary (QHAS)<a href="https://docs.qualcomm.com/doc/80-63442-10/topic/htp_backend.html#qnn-htp-analysis-summary-qhas" title="Click to copy section url" class="chain-icon"><span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-front)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-link"><path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"></path><path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"></path></svg></span></a></h2>
